ce verification passes, commit only the WireGuard system-state\nimplementation.\n\nCommit message:\n\nWormOS: WireGuard system-state integration\n\nCreate annotated tag:\n\nwormos-wg-system-state\n\nTag message:\n\nWormOS WireGuard system-state implementation.\n\nIncludes system-owned WormSystemWireGuard, official pinned WireGuard Android\nbackend, source-built wireguard-go, VPN lockdown/fail-closed, protected DNS,\nboot lifecycle and required system integration.\n\nBuild/runtime validation tracked separately.\n\nNever move this tag after publishing.\n\n============================================================\n6. STORAGE CHECK\n============================================================\n\nUse:\n\nANDROID_BUILD_TOP=/opt/worm/worktrees/wg-ota/android\nOUT_DIR=/opt/worm/build-wg/out\nTMPDIR=/opt/worm/build-wg/tmp\n\nCheck actual disk space before build.\n\nRequired:\n\nBUILD_SPACE_OK=YES\n\nDo not use /opt/Android.\nDo not use /opt/worm/build.\n\n============================================================\n7. BUILD SYSTEM-STATE OTA\n============================================================\n\nBuild in this order:\n\n1. source-built wireguard-go\n2. WormSystemWireGuard\n3. required affected platform/product components\n4. target-files-package\n5. OTA package\n\nDo not add unrelated build targets unless required by dependency resolution.\n\n============================================================\n8. VERIFY RESULTING TARGET-FILES\n============================================================\n\nProve the generated target-files contain:\n\n- WormSystemWireGuard.apk\n- source-built libwg-go.so\n- WireGuard Android backend runtime pieces\n- required product package declarations\n- privileged permissions/config\n- boot/autostart integration\n- required fail-closed integration\n- protected DNS integration\n- required SELinux policy/domain mapping\n\nRequired:\n\nWG_BACKEND=PASS\nBACKEND_SOURCE_BUILD=PASS\nBACKEND_PACKAGED=PASS\nSYSTEM_OWNED_WG=PASS\nSELINUX=PASS\