=====================\n\nOnly if PREBUILD_STAGE_B=PASS:\n\nBuild only the minimum target required to produce WormSystemWireGuard and its\ndirect dependencies.\n\nDo not start product build.\nDo not build target-files.\nDo not generate OTA.\n\nExpected module:\n\nWormSystemWireGuard\n\nUse the existing source-built libwg-go result.\n\n============================================================\n3. VERIFY APK OUTPUT\n============================================================\n\nAfter build, locate the actual APK.\n\nRecord:\n\nWORMSYSTEMWIREGUARD_APK=\nWORMSYSTEMWIREGUARD_APK_SHA256=\nWORMSYSTEMWIREGUARD_APK_SIZE=\n\nVerify:\n\nAPK exists\nAPK is non-empty\nAPK corresponds to the current source state\nAPK was built in this Stage B run\n\nRequired:\n\nWORMSYSTEMWIREGUARD_BUILD=PASS\n\n============================================================\n4. VERIFY SYSTEM/PRIVILEGED INTEGRATION\n============================================================\n\nInspect source/build metadata and APK packaging.\n\nVerify:\n\n- product package inclusion\n- privileged/system placement\n- expected package name\n- expected manifest permissions\n- expected service/VpnService declarations\n- boot/autostart components\n- expected native backend loading\n- no user-facing WireGuard app dependency\n\nReport:\n\nSYSTEM_APP_PACKAGING=\nPRIVILEGED_APP_CONFIG=\nVPN_SERVICE_DECLARATION=\nBOOT_AUTOSTART_DECLARATION=\nWG_NATIVE_BACKEND_REFERENCE=\n\nRequired:\n\nSYSTEM_OWNED_WG_PACKAGING=PASS\n\n============================================================\n5. VERIFY libwg-go RELATIONSHIP\n============================================================\n\nVerify the app/module build consumes the intended source-built backend from\nStage A rather than a stale or prebuilts copy.\n\nExpected source-built artifact provenance:\n\nBACKEND_COMMIT=\ne7b3a3c118836e112620b1302a8ba1873ad4daac\n\nRequired:\n\nBACKEND_SOURCE_BUILD=PASS\nBACKEND_USED_BY_STAGE_B=PASS\nBACKEND_PINNED=PASS\nPROVENANCE_MATCH=PASS\n\n============================================================\n6. SELINUX / SECURITY SOURCE CHECK\n============================================================\n\nDo not claim full product SELinux compilation yet.\n\nVerify Stage B does not introduce a new policy blocker and remains consistent\nwith the previously accepted existing priv_app-domain model.\n\nRequired:\n\nSELINUX_SOURCE=PASS\nNO_SECRETS=PASS\n\nRun a fresh scoped secret scan over modified/current WireGuard integration\nsources before concluding Stage B.\n\n============================================================\n7. POST-STAGE-B SOURCE CHECK\n============================================================\n\nAfter build verify source state was not modified unexpectedly by tooling.\n\nRequired:\n\nUNACCEPTED_DIRTY_WORK=0\n\nGenerated build output under /opt/worm/build/out must not count as dirty\nsource.\n\n============================================================\n8. WRITE REPORTS\n============================================================\n\nCreate:\n\n/opt/worm/artifacts/reports/PREBUILD-WG-WormSystemWireGuard-<timestamp>.md\n\nand:\n\n/opt/worm/artifacts/reports/WORMSYSTEMWIREGUARD-STAGE-B-BUILD-<timestamp>.md\n\nDo not overwrite Stage A reports.\n\n============================================================\n9. HARD STOP AFTER STAGE B\n============================================================\n\nEven if Stage B passes:\n\nSTOP.\n\nDo not start Stage C.\n\nRequired final state:\n\nPREBUILD_STAGE_C=NOT_RUN\nPRODUCT_BUILD=NOT_RUN\nTARGET_FILES_BUILD=NOT_RUN\nOTA_BUILD=NOT_RUN\n\n============================================================\nFINAL REPORT\n============================================================\n\nSTAGE_A_ARTIFACT_PRESENT=\nSTAGE_A_ARTIFACT_HASH_MATCH=\n\nPREBUILD_STAGE_B=\n\nWORMSYSTEMWIREGUARD_BUILD=\nWORMSYSTEMWIREGUARD_APK=\nWORMSYSTEMWIREGUARD_APK_SHA256=\nWORMSYSTEMWIREGUARD_APK_SIZE=\n\nSYSTEM_APP_PACKAGING=\nPRIVILEGED_APP_CONFIG=\nVPN_SERVICE_DECLARATION=\nBOOT_AUTOSTART_DECLARATION=\nWG_NATIVE_BACKEND_REFERENCE=\nSYSTEM_OWNED_WG_PACKAGING=\n\nBACKEND_USED_BY_STAGE_B=\nBACKEND_SOURCE_BUILD=\nBACKEND_PINNED=\nPROVENANCE_MATCH=\n\nSELINUX_SOURCE=\nNO_SECRETS=\nUNACCEPTED_DIRTY_WORK=\n\nPREBUILD_STAGE_C=NOT_RUN\nPRODUCT_BUILD=NOT_RUN\nTARGET_FILES_BUILD=NOT_RUN\nOTA_BUILD=NOT_RUN\n\nBLOCKERS="}
