===\n\nPATCH: PASS/FAIL\n\nWIREGUARD INTERFACE:\nWIREGUARD HANDSHAKE:\nOPNSENSE:\nOPNSENSE ROOT CAUSE:\nSTATUS API:\nFOOTER GLYPH:\n\nHETZNER API:\nROBOT:\nROBOT IP TYPE:\nROBOT IP REASSIGNABLE:\nPRIVATE NETWORK:\nFIREWALL AUDIT:\nSNAPSHOT/MIRROR SOURCE:\n\nMIRROR STRATEGY:\nINFRASTRUCTURE CHANGES: NONE\nSECRET SCAN:\nVERIFY:\nREADY FOR MIRROR STEP: YES/NO","text_elements":[]}]},"started_at_ms":1788803383967,"completed_at_ms":1788803383967}}
