rinted or stored  \nVERIFY: PASS  \nREADY FOR MIRROR STEP: NO\n\nCreated patch artifacts in:\n`/opt/worm/patches/PATCH-INFRA-004-opnsense-hetzner-audit/`\n\nUpdated:\n`/opt/worm/control/api-status/`\n`/opt/Android/dashboard/app/services/network_status.py`\n`/opt/worm/changelog/timeline.json`"}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a07cfd-824b-7f02-bc90-316a5bfb74bc","create_time":1788804218.482043,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a07d0c-a6f3-7420-917a-1a9defb0e91b","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Finalizza PATCH-INFRA-004 e consolida il Control Plane sotto /opt/worm.\n\nSTATO:\n- PATCH-INFRA-004: PASS\n- OPNsense: PASS\n- /api/status/network: operational\n- Hetzner API: PASS\n- robot non presente nella Hetzner Cloud API interrogata\n- robot IP reassignment: NON consentito/non dimostrato\n- mirror step: non ancora pronto\n\n1. CONTROL PLANE PATH\n\nAudit:\n  /opt/Android/dashboard\n\nConfrontalo con:\n  /opt/worm/control/\n\nMigra sotto /opt/worm/control/ tutto ciò che serve realmente\na worm.estixari.com.\n\nDopo la migrazione:\n- nessun componente runtime del Control Plane deve dipendere da\n  /opt/Android/dashboard\n- preserva git history e modifiche Worm\n- NON cancellare ancora /opt/Android/dashboard\n\nAggiorna PATCH-INFRA-004 e gli script al path definitivo /opt/worm.\n\n2. ABOUT\n\nIntegra definitivamente:\n  WORM Network Architecture\n\nnella pagina:\n  worm.estixari.com/about\n\nCrea un asset path stabile, ad esempio:\n  /opt/worm/control/dashboard/public/assets/about/worm-network-architecture.png\n\nSe il file immagine non è disponibile localmente, crea esattamente\nquesto target e segnala COPY REQUIRED.\nNON ridisegnare l'immagine.\n\nUI:\n- responsive\n- aspect ratio originale\n- desktop large/full container\n- mobile width 100%\n- tap/click per visualizzazione grande\n\n3. FOOTER STATUS\n\nUsa esclusivamente:\n/api/status/network\n\nVisualizzazione:\n\nworm OS <=> OPNsense   ●\n\n● verde quando status=operational\n● rosso altrimenti\n\nNon mostrare IP nel footer.\n\n4. HETZNER\n\nRegistra il risultato dell'audit:\n\n- Hetzner API: PASS\n- worm-opnsense: presente\n- worm-private: presente\n- robot: non presente nella Cloud API interrogata\n- robot IP type: UNKNOWN\n- robot IP reassignment: NO\n\nNON tentare reassignment.\nNON creare mirror in questo passaggio.\n\n5. CHANGELOG\n\nAggiungi PATCH-INFRA-004 alla timeline/changelog:\n- OPNsense health-check corretto\n- HTTPS private-path health probe\n- Hetzner read-only audit\n- nessuna modifica firewall/networking\n\n6. VERIFY\n\nNon modificare:\n- OPNsense\n- WireGuard\n- firewall\n- routing\n- OTA\n- GrapheneOS build\n\nOutput:\n\nCONTROL ROOT:\nOLD DASHBOARD DEPENDENCY:\nABOUT IMAGE:\nABOUT PAGE:\nSTATUS API:\nFOOTER:\nFOOTER CURRENT STATE:\nPATCH-INFRA-004:\nCHANGELOG:\nHETZNER AUDIT:\nROBOT IP REASSIGNMENT:\nSECRET SCAN:\nREADY TO DEPLOY CONTROL PLANE:"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a07d0c-a6cc-7d73-b22e-d0d25bd13356","create_time":1788804376.3072994,"content_item_kinds":["user.text"]}},{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_0d4d71abca8c0b20016a9efd1bd45087d294008be0590ee4e6","summary":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABqnv0flMG5ljOQwpkGLEtOwA3iHXqeskUEtPRP9SWYHii5iBCB1pBwWN4FaS-1l-UAHcJuVy3yGiV6c3GBRGhBYzJQkbSMBquuri3Vhf3JV5dsTyv6ji-q3OvwNkWGEKACHDqQ2ycosFt0AgEc-WuQBlwmb0MmXJ1uL7YSIlhNA1sG_UsE_AnDLUxLZzrxId5YtZgLC13Lvfv9J6q8LcBi-UMnsQ0rdgi5Fm-izgrjQxHrndtj_rY0khoaZgRumZ-pfXYXNR6NGDf0rWMRHj20dLJd4pzoDBW1JMeq7ETPoPZE57Pc5Z0xPN-BFeAMgjA94USMf6YXaYmelTRXTlvoEdY0YDNMfAOAARbCaWt5Iuv1UevjD_k6haKDY--DHek6zXFQh4sANwB5cSEO3EqyD5wKlgqljieQ1QUo0T1r53EaSxM6FSleF_bbLvTW5bvGjx923O6UYaAUjHNi3fW77hYFKRwCL7dmtGwuxgCvynAhp9-5Nmsb-i4lGNu3rNTe5ZA3eTXMwLx_BKrR_aA-V6OCv_M6CcZdSqXkajmTjTlBp1ZN4El-S0OPOqC6X0isf5aLYDA7HC3npTEp7t9GTh2XVuQzutnpuMscy7VWf66wc2_bre-QXBg1y1GdJMhDc7w1v-FFkd09SxLPBhvELvmfaYtxKglaLLuBj8U770M36cUUG8PJt5DUD5F5QuSAlW-snmGRkRP92g5FQ5MPIUTq0s3c7GQiNQH6ml