riendly platform and pleasant user experience while enforcing modern security and privacy practices and offering robust validity guarantees for installed apps.\\n\",\"iconType\":\"webp\",\"variants\":{\"55\":{\"versionCode\":55,\"apks\":[\"base.apk\"],\"apkHashes\":[\"40f97ac3ee659d8b1f91dba8b84449fe3c14e05c1e82754375252d8746e6b1f5\"],\"apkSizes\":[6954309],\"apkGzSizes\":[2959969],\"apkBrSizes\":[2407858],\"versionName\":\"0.28.1\",\"minSdk\":29,\"label\":\"Accrescent\",\"channel\":\"stable\",\"abis\":[\"arm64-v8a\",\"armeabi-v7a\",\"x86\",\"x86_64\"]}}},\"app.attestation.auditor\":{\"signatures\":[\"990e04f0864b19f14f84e0e432f7a393f297ab105a22c1e1b10b442a4a62c42c\"],\"source\":\"GrapheneOS\",\"hasFsVeritySignatures\":true,\"description\":\"The Auditor app uses hardware security features on supported devices to validate the integrity of the operating system from another Android device. It will verify that the device is running the stock operating system with the bootloader locked and that no tampering with the operating system has occurred. It will also detect downgrades to a previous version.\\n\",\"iconType\":\"webp\",\"variants\":{\"92\":{\"versionCode\":92,\"apks\":[\"base.apk\"],\"apkHashes\":[\"f54d47ae7f57871906020d5dc1c32ef44913ca18cf79a6771d812a9c9e012bca\"],\"apkSizes\":[3141714],\"apkGzSizes\":[1375744],\"apkBrSizes\":[1188927],\"versionName\":\"92\",\"minSdk\":33,\"label\":\"Auditor\",\"channel\":\"stable\",\"hasV4Signatures\":true,\"abis\":[\"arm64-v8a\",\"armeabi-v7a\",\"x86\",\"x86_64\"]}}},\"app.grapheneos.AppCompatConfig\":{\"signatures\":[\"e5044303e85b4cceaae00ecf8823c9c6f937a8e3a2fb632ec9fa45b2c33b4bd1\"],\"source\":\"GrapheneOS\",\"hasFsVeritySignatures\":true,\"isTopLevel\":false,\"noCode\":true,\"staticDeps\":[\"app.grapheneos.AppCompatConfig >= 1\"],\"description\":\"<p>AppCompatConfig is a part of GrapheneOS. It's a file that specifies compatibility of some apps\\nwith the optional GrapheneOS per-app exploit protection features, which allows to automatically\\nenable or disable them by default.</p>\\n\\n<p>The main purpose of AppCompatConfig is to enable additional exploit protections for popular apps\\nthat are known to be compatible with them.</p>\\n\\n<p>Automatic disabling of exploit protection features can be turned off via <b>Settings&nbsp;>\\nSecurity&nbsp;> Automatic exploit protection compatibility mode</b> toggle.</p>\\n\",\"variants\":{\"8\":{\"versionCode\":8,\"apks\":[\"base.apk\"],\"apkHashes\":[\"992839e93d11e1c0e8446a34f8e36528933094420fedc259e45e6b4d1c580b53\"],\"apkSizes\":[20500],\"apkGzSizes\":[17028],\"apkBrSizes\":[16798],\"versionName\":\"8\",\"minSdk\":34,\"label\":\"AppCompatConfig\",\"channel\":\"stable\",\"hasV4Signatures\":true}}},\"app.grapheneos.camera\":{\"signatures\":[\"6436b155b917c2f9a9ed1d15c4993a5968ffabc94947c13f2aeee14b7b27ed59\"],\"source\":\"GrapheneOS\",\"hasFsVeritySignatures\":true,\"description\":\"A modern camera app focused on privacy and security. It includes modes for capturing images, videos and QR / barcode scanning along with additional modes based on CameraX vendor extensions (Portrait, HDR, Night, Face Retouch and Auto) on devices where they're available.\\n\",\"iconType\":\"webp\",\"variants\":{\"93\":{\"versionCode\":93,\"apks\":[\"base.apk\"],\"apkHashes\":[\"6e1d05a7b96b308f3a9dff3103db55cfee2cbea38b3249b5879fe35cfcf179ff\"],\"apkSizes\":[3931896],\"apkGzSizes\":[1807400],\"apkBrSizes\":[1552089],\"versionName\":\"93\",\"minSdk\":29,\"label\":\"Camera\",\"channel\":\"stable\",\"hasV4Signatures\":true,\"abis\":[\"arm64-v8a\",\"armeabi-v7a\",\"x86\",\"x86_64\"]}}},\"app.grapheneos.gmscompat.config\":{\"signatures\":[\"6ebb65c5daa95641f7a774ea35d26ff251575cb32e34a8a5d655b2742b57321f\"],\"source\":\"GrapheneOS\",\"hasFsVeritySignatures\":true,\"isTopLevel\":false,\"noCode\":true,\"packagesAllowedToTriggerUpdate\":[\"app.grapheneos.gmscompat\"],\"staticDeps\":[\"app.grapheneos.gmscompat >= 1000\"],\"description\":\"GmsCompatConfig is a configuration