ering PDFs in a sandbox without requiring any permissions.\\n\",\"iconType\":\"webp\",\"variants\":{\"31\":{\"versionCode\":31,\"apks\":[\"base.apk\"],\"apkHashes\":[\"a543ce816d685f39dc215ed6df522c3e1eda6ccbc8007e4e884cedb2c38c7d19\"],\"apkSizes\":[3660613],\"apkGzSizes\":[3162599],\"apkBrSizes\":[3116230],\"versionName\":\"31\",\"minSdk\":26,\"label\":\"PDF Viewer\",\"channel\":\"stable\",\"hasV4Signatures\":true},\"33\":{\"versionCode\":33,\"apks\":[\"base.apk\"],\"apkHashes\":[\"8baf331478b72e5f2f69407ffbaec1d0d6aa128b941735d3d7d2c091e4e6b675\"],\"apkSizes\":[4829050],\"apkGzSizes\":[4206215],\"apkBrSizes\":[4160399],\"versionName\":\"33\",\"minSdk\":26,\"label\":\"PDF Viewer\",\"channel\":\"stable\",\"hasV4Signatures\":true,\"abis\":[\"arm64-v8a\",\"armeabi-v7a\",\"x86\",\"x86_64\"]}}},\"app.grapheneos.speechservices\":{\"signatures\":[\"e4ed212b02b55bc33464938df68d04f60dff04dd3ac982b8b8240441e05f1b2f\"],\"source\":\"GrapheneOS\",\"hasFsVeritySignatures\":true,\"description\":\"Speech Services provides fast, efficient, and high-quality text-to-speech using state-of-the-art\\nmodels running completely on-device.\\n\\nIt uses our fork of Matcha-TTS with major speed and efficiency improvements alongside a phonemizer\\nwritten in Kotlin, based on the Misaki phonemizer and the Apache OpenNLP library for text\\npreprocessing.\\n\",\"variants\":{\"1\":{\"versionCode\":1,\"apks\":[\"base.apk\"],\"apkHashes\":[\"b51ca6efb9c5af95fa9ddb53f737592b0acd8ab9e1e3f95fff04060a1464588f\"],\"apkSizes\":[161601974],\"apkGzSizes\":[85089677],\"apkBrSizes\":[66017062],\"versionName\":\"1\",\"minSdk\":36,\"label\":\"GrapheneOS Speech Services\",\"channel\":\"stable\",\"hasV4Signatures\":true,\"abis\":[\"arm64-v8a\",\"armeabi-v7a\",\"x86\",\"x86_64\"]},\"3\":{\"versionCode\":3,\"apks\":[\"base.apk\"],\"apkHashes\":[\"cacbe72f4ac05e30cb874947513cbd6702faa7aea49615100cfdaee0b0ad056c\"],\"apkSizes\":[75506283],\"apkGzSizes\":[52855159],\"apkBrSizes\":[42916658],\"versionName\":\"3\",\"min