otstrap UDP socket protection for `2.28.34.27:51823`.\n- Transition from `BLOCKED` to `PROTECTED` after authenticated handshake.\n# Fail Closed\n\nImplemented:\n\n- The service establishes a VPN TUN with `0.0.0.0/0` and `::/0`.\n- No packets are forwarded by V1 without a WireGuard backend.\n- Underlying network changes re-enter `BLOCKED`.\n- Service restart re-enters `BLOCKED`.\n\nSecurity result for V1:\n\n- Direct IPv4 fallback is blocked when this VPN is active.\n- Direct IPv6 fallback is blocked when this VPN is active.\n- Production traffic is not allowed until the backend can prove the\n  WireGuard tunnel is authenticated and protected.\n\nPending:\n\n- Runtime proof on a flashed device.\n- Explicit endpoint bootstrap socket using `VpnService.protect()`.\n- Handover and crash tests.\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a07f78-3e99-7e03-a9dd-f83b026f1b4e","create_time":1788845084.397518}},{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_0d4d71abca8c0b20016a9f9c1db47087d2ba68f9007233c43a","summary":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABqn5wexMP5XhCJcqEIkRjAqsSU52rFKQgEmby3OuHQxf3ug5aPpCZ7QE1t7PjPI5YILSOqqzu546ozdpLTpnmaLHa3kKbjNCy10Fyg5DysmEE202ZtPXEiuG1_P3sbUopuNfUveXJT-_7ZC9qN6V5hsuPB4GHrXXF0mJn4-AwWcf2fJ6PfnU6cfQ54mhHnwv0djTzl6-Odc7rJyZqhkmWP4wOZEKOUpnzvVzT_ooLiCev1WUG9kH-LbSwC-_bsMv3QuVVoFeRgYrC7bzyTAsGkd3a7RgWR-MomZVbjvHyGX-LleTbonASAlJE5ZwGTfllzaGW9SwzKXDni432VbbF1Q41HMShRdHYFQajXa_9i-2PGpK9pKBceJfNTmaoDbu1BQC2p_p5mXOLrld8pXralxidga50_3NU_lnjXR-NyhpRvglQyYgV-bJ2Zl8ldln_4rAMDK6VVlkKSUBS_jrz-jljQtUMu0Fyu6ys-zX5QeoytrOeIkwt_ZBkQnhoayFOttXp8lx9nIqK770gnO6f439XXVdtNxBc_aRACX1m9LixOs2fg6C4J-9hMtepGt5HgMpsqwGin8nv4NsDmZcLzQFOHLRf4nx0RVu8xuPa8X2RSd-VcXUrQNkG3vKKxiLC_pFvXkt7sAn60pf0qARnvge6etwqmA8RccQs9sMWiiAkkLwRC1M-tRP6eXF0c82GkHjCnnWKoWaac5pCQI-ORfOfLzcFje193eeGStkNjaGlzmu7xi0-HQljaC6wMXbkICAWVdh4vW6KLc98bBatOYlttIzxuRzYbl4lFjW9FtX6698tqkHNz0cR27dSxQWt6vU7VJqAzEmhRysaxTAxPeZ6z_0oZuR7DqQFzf6mwDV-ZODjDDDCgS-arH9PK9NfeBJGqi_CQRS_ne1DCmk2RZ6gF6XDaUgNUQz-1XUdYJYye2Ly6A