ation notes:\n+\n+- The imported source is scoped to `external/wireguard-worm`.\n+- `libwg-go.so` is built by Soong from pinned vendored source.\n+- `WormSystemWireGuard` loads `libwg-go` through `System.loadLibrary(\"wg-go\")`.\n+- `WormWireGuardBackend` starts the backend against the VpnService TUN fd and\n+  protects only the backend UDP sockets.\n+- The user-facing WireGuard Android app is not packaged.\n*** End Patch\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a07f9a-4db3-7512-bae2-e83dc8203e75","create_time":1788853087.865532}},{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a07ff4-3348-75b0-93bb-6bacfd3c06c9","call_id":"call_EOuuSuVukB3awua6Yolu9gqT","output":"Exit code: 0\nWall time: 0.7 seconds\nOutput:\nSuccess. Updated the following files:\nM /opt/Android/PATCH-WORMOS-SYSTEM-WG-BACKEND-V3/01-BACKEND-SELECTION.md\nM /opt/Android/PATCH-WORMOS-SYSTEM-WG-BACKEND-V3/03-INTEGRATION-PLAN.md\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a07f9a-4db3-7512-bae2-e83dc8203e75","create_time":1788853105.4806688}},{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_0d4d71abca8c0b20016a9fbb7417bc87d2b057c3f9360dfc1b","summary":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABqn7t0RmIIiDDtndycdPwt8_a_JbduruEYg7zD0nQvltFPwAoCkK-ewa4RuBlJ-Fx3R-KsAgE6DNGr4OzRXXbsMdhObx9Jr4PiP82c7xwlhMMMeuJ4KyO3Az6ff-RlB1kSrLiC6KK4O35ZB39UlNxfW6lFQ7gj9mYsEHB9ApieQs_9JhZruwpnvIyeocHaw4Bpq634zxzZxs7XQc4RUP9jcxn31n62peh6pYGN5BTpVX7i_R2OZ-Rx-hVwGg04pBB5pfM_BLqfZAJgnf5IXC3xtcDJWxm9kEeYA4TAjrjMRdAEgXeMZZWBf-nV5WbPFrvpF7hIfeUFRR6i0w0SWU73-PXgyC4Yd5p6OJKICfRmiO8Xxd1A_AxFdyMWXZtA6Hhk6JYXo3EFAhpGqmmib9r10ZVGHUwZt_oTzwWjs_huMpmf0DuDkYqEkz6ERawCvRXM8KQBcRzLVfN-iyjtoRL8NiFoB2ydXBv8apPnEy2yEyxTWVVlOFA8J6mFdd9LW0GZETyLi4np2lZ01uBUCykkFshbHOvOqwfedVzuoXqXImSW6LiEpvt_Vzx-PjrHwo_OiLtkyIM7cE_nQX0F3862WUKq7dZwmAviUymYW-q4ajHDigTp9qetx-d7BIm6-MyUV_dRFyVQDX6DGaVCI6ewb_drburYbu_esFrXWcnCQuB0ogQw4H0-1XPdPjJDCRLiMVQjj3zxWF9iDR0lal3Fl-WwMRTJ29QQefYEyhQsPt-4AtrrnvJPhi-pE_iFx2N-L7yZ9ABe3gs82bbzkiM1KD9HgjWvGkOwrN58GWaJkaWoDnqj3Qo