old target-files packages\n- old OTA packages\n- obsolete build intermediates\n- duplicate previous device build outputs\n- caches\n- temporary files\n- stale logs/traces\n- previous failed build artifacts\n\nProduce a ranked storage report.\n\nDo NOT delete anything until the candidates are classified.\n\n============================================================\n2. SAFE CLEANUP POLICY\n============================================================\n\nSAFE candidates may include only artifacts that can be regenerated and are\nnot required for the current source state.\n\nPrefer, in this order:\n\n1. stale temporary files from failed builds;\n2. old build logs / traces;\n3. obsolete previous target-files/OTA artifacts;\n4. duplicate build outputs from older builds;\n5. safe build caches;\n6. regenerable intermediates not needed for incremental continuation.\n\nPreserve:\n\n- source trees;\n- .git repositories;\n- WormOS patch directories;\n- PATCH-WORMOS-SYSTEM-WG-BACKEND-V3;\n- SOURCE-PROVENANCE.md;\n- imported/pinned WireGuard source;\n- current WormSystemWireGuard source;\n- current product configuration;\n- signing configuration/material;\n- secrets/credentials;\n- current successful libwg-go.so build inputs;\n- required GrapheneOS source/checkouts.\n\nIf a candidate is ambiguous, DO NOT DELETE IT.\n\n============================================================\n3. SPACE TARGET\n============================================================\n\nEstimate the storage required to complete:\n\n- target-files-package;\n- OTA generation if applicable;\n- final validation;\n- temporary packaging overhead.\n\nReclaim enough space with a reasonable safety margin.\n\nReport:\n\nSPACE_BEFORE=\nSPACE_RECLAIMED=\nSPACE_AFTER=\nESTIMATED_REQUIRED=\nSAFETY_MARGIN=\n\n============================================================\n4. RESUME BUILD\n============================================================\n\nAfter cleanup, resume the current build.\n\nDo not unnecessarily rebuild everything if the existing incremental output\nis valid.\n\nRun:\n\n1. WormSystemWireGuard module build if required;\n2. backend/source integrity check;\n3. target-files-package;\n4. packaging verification;\n5. SELinux validation;\n6. license/NOTICE validation;\n7. dependency audit;\n8. secret scan;\n9. target-files inspection.\n\nVerify specifically that the completed target-files package contains:\n\n- WormSystemWireGuard.apk\n- source-built libwg-go.so\n- required backend runtime components\n\n============================================================\n5. DO NOT OVERSTATE RESULTS\n============================================================\n\nIf target-files succeeds:\n\nBUILD=PASS\n\nIf SELinux is actually rerun successfully:\n\nSELINUX=PASS\n\nIf backend is present and source-built in the completed target-files:\n\nWG_BACKEND=PASS\nBACKEND_SOURCE_BUILD=PASS\nBACKEND_PACKAGED=PASS\n\nDevice/runtime tests remain DEVICE_TEST_REQUIRED until a physical flashed\ndevice is tested.\n\nOTA_READY must remain NO until those runtime tests pass.\n\n============================================================\n6. FINAL STATUS\n============================================================\n\nReport:\n\nSOURCE_IMPLEMENTATION=\nBUILD=\nSELINUX=\nSYSTEM_OWNED_WG=\nWG_BACKEND=\nBACKEND_SOURCE_BUILD=\nBACKEND_PACKAGED=\nBACKEND_PINNED=\nUPSTREAM_SOURCE_VERIFIED=\nLOCKDOWN_INTEGRATION=\nNO_SECRETS=\nSERVER_NETWORK=\nWORM_OS_SYSTEM_NETWORK=\n\nSTORAGE_BLOCKER=\nSPACE_BEFORE=\nSPACE_RECLAIMED=\nSPACE_AFTER=\nFILES_DELETED=\nFILES_PRESERVED=\nTARGET_FILES_PACKAGE=\nTARGET_FILES_BACKEND_EVIDENCE=\nTESTS_EXECUTED=\nDEVICE_TESTS_REQUIRED=\nBLOCKERS=\nOTA_READY=\n\nExpected if cleanup/build succeeds but device tests are not yet performed:\n\nSOURCE_IMPLEMENTATION=PASS\nBUILD=PASS\nSELINUX=PASS\nSYSTEM_OWNED_WG=PASS\nWG_BACKEND=PASS\nBACKEND_SOURCE_BUILD=PASS\nBACKEND_PACKAGED=PASS\nBACKEND_PINNED=PASS\nUPSTREAM_SOURCE_VERIFIED=PASS\nNO_SECRETS=PASS\nSERVER_NETWORK=FROZEN_UNCHANGED\nSTORAGE_BLOCKER=RESOLVED\nOTA_READY=NO"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a08059-5d7d-7161-9c22-81c40b7c8bc9","create_time":1788859735.6043212,"content_item_kinds":["user.text"]}},{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_0d4d71abca8c0b20016a9fd55b945887d2a709a580abdf98a3","summary":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABqn9Vca7J1Jp1Z1h8z0n5aYdz5yUnfIm6_nqQVCM--pyePLJ8DlkST8O62CnSnqBB7oIdOgK3aK-9BKzXkNs0P633okmfPKHT3dPKsKs6NsGC3YxjjbpRZeFYELTXuOdrnw8tH0jpsVSsvRyyPzo1T4BZEwP_keFE8PG448Q5ubOgcTIOgte1KAyCYKPKrCKJdIS-YbAkL1OaoEaxqyDPASr1FFMn4_CLqStzlUC_1EdXfqgLC9FPINZtst0FbZhGKb9cyW0q-v94PIJDDYiBplQiyAxHErI3HkIqBidtgGc1AhzSmqQEetts6VPTSQh7NwZsvYG854xaBulpwBlwBvSXLvwxqwUmsNVqT8Xatn8dJCsudcLkgy5QWlZ8WSe7zvPpwYOjpHizKEjLiT6t3F1ryPO7n6DLKe7-AlayHZa8yeuV8qLBcH0KprUld_r0eFB6j5-JmYLAhZVruskqytwRrX53_Na9gLH0oKhH2GT4od1sjRu9hYJt1pyMO4-Mefg1FD-VRaYSIipWCkEE_c4EjZ4n9OW1BQrks0vtCEwcUpbSUQEnSTbWeFcScJ9bBdsbGWJBF2_zg0cL9126EggUJzpKqcnHO9sbuYtzQgJ4rySjG1UiUzQaPGLMm_HTSxKMTURY2SZ4MzmSWF2LZhXKiJfQf40yrTOdSyFRpy8OuIIyEhWBHMQpMUGgl8ASPxYMUqG0twdliwOKkh1f18z-wFr5jWMd2Tqe1_xqsV86xy8hWZ35JXmd4Vk0cx47Y73rVg0xvKeluceXYdTkAVwYLzh-1qzHtv_i6-oQPd_n0jDFmc2Z9UIzIAiqyFGbTvyXZ97wl4maE8U3yVy1C2SdUkxQbAOo1OAjNG8eS3BdybcGLxx617Mtllmb5ovPSP9j66FdSt9H4h_lYpav5MUyuCzP7Bnmu_h3EVA1EhYyrO2NO3gCNG84hx-ol2354bs0ijVJbaPTo_4RH3Lvez8pvoElUmxLcdzw_5gnN3J_0qmS1WoJQJPvKiGq6rg738mfc9h_1y-YqL2lorq5tZzmoFkB43bW1mExt-KVfMH6knMZHx-do0q0tPy2dOvW85gwZQpjjYysq2N6bnMSDHvepa7IrUneePbFX-rfKx6diVkRqFFbPoXhxM7cOlrnE0fTsDXWgo1XZWZ4VTt69scv9_WId4QxO7bDJnAQJRP9tHPB7V5zIrjSo-a0o5Ro9-mt_AT8u_f8UXTbzWv2eWsj8Gf1GCiALxGdDpVyIqhOUQL3pims3LENLmM3tuPFYlOIxbspvaKOq-dRBPUWGGFHewU6v0vne7cBQiu6vAaM_IfaquqGEYuLvi3-cUuBvv6mLJ9gBqotXOkkNXluzB9As9H6e7orpJOklQzNRE7mrF9fLyg80dzLD_liNuWjpiLmug0A3S2Da844dHzftiZkwj9-1aP0pMb1BEgUWJb8Aucm827zyMGDDvg6NtiKvLmPdgIW_8SN6yNq-LxDnyt7L7zOvHZ2QqNGHphM3oZfwnFmeAkCu_9D1wvogNuf6phIjNkeZvgcxtuTXFAqcJx4xug==","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a08059-5d7d-7161-9c22-81c40b7c8bc9"}},{"type":"m