nical root: `/opt/worm`.' '' '## Canonical Paths' '' '- `/opt/worm/src` = source trees.' '- `/opt/worm/src/android` = canonical Android / GrapheneOS checkout location.' '- `/opt/worm/build` = disposable local build workspace.' '- `/opt/worm/build/out` = Android `OUT_DIR`.' '- `/opt/worm/build/target-files` = generated target-files packages.' '- `/opt/worm/build/ota` = generated OTA packages.' '- `/opt/worm/build/logs` = build logs.' '- `/opt/worm/build/tmp` = temporary build files.' '- `/opt/worm/patches` = persistent WormOS patch documentation and patch artifacts.' '- `/opt/worm/vendor` = pinned third-party source imported for WormOS.' '- `/opt/worm/vendor/wireguard` = pinned WireGuard backend source/provenance area.' '- `/opt/worm/config` = non-secret build, product, SELinux and network configuration.' '- `/opt/worm/scripts` = project tooling.' '- `/opt/worm/artifacts` = persistent outputs, reports and provenance.' '- `/opt/worm/cache` = disposable caches.' '- `/opt/worm/manifests` = source revision metadata.' '- `/opt/worm/backup/metadata` = backup metadata only, not secret material.' '' '## Build Environment' '' 'Use `/opt/worm/config/build/env.sh` before Android builds. It defines:' '' '```sh' 'WORM_ROOT=/opt/worm' 'ANDROID_BUILD_TOP=/opt/worm/src/android' 'OUT_DIR=/opt/worm/build/out' 'TMPDIR=/opt/worm/build/tmp' 'CCACHE_DIR=/opt/worm/cache/ccache' '```' '' 'The environment file intentionally contains no secrets.' '' '## Build Policy' '' 'Live GrapheneOS builds must run from `/opt/worm/src/android` with generated output in `/opt/worm/build/out`.' '' 'The previous Android tree stored on Storage Box is archive/reference material only. It must not be used as the live build workspace.' '' '## Cleanup Policy' '' '`/opt/worm/scripts/maintenance/worm-clean.sh` may clean only disposable build/log/cache areas. It must never delete source, patches, vendor source, manifests, config, scripts, provenance, signing material or credentials.' '' '## Current Legacy/Ambiguous State' '' '- `/opt/worm/build/grapheneos-frankel-17` currently contains an existing GrapheneOS checkout mixed with build output. It was not moved automatically.' '- `/opt/worm/android-pull.sh` and `/opt/worm/storagebox.sh` are legacy Storage Box tooling and were not moved because one matching pull process was observed writing to the old `/opt/Android` path.' '- Root-level product areas such as `/opt/worm/ota`, `/opt/worm/tools`, `/opt/worm/worm-os`, `/opt/worm/app-store`, `/opt/worm/distribution`, `/opt/worm/control`, `/opt/worm/security`, and `/opt/worm/ssh` were left in place until their runtime references are audited.' '- Existing `/opt/worm/patches/PATCH-INFRA-004-opnsense-hetzner-audit` was already under `/opt/worm/patches` and was preserved.' > /opt/worm/docs/FILESYSTEM-LAYOUT.md\",\"workdir\":\"/opt/worm\",\"yield_time_ms\":1000,\"max_output_tokens\":2000,\"sandbox_permissions\":\"require_escalated\",\"justification\":\"Allow writing the requested filesystem layout documentation under /opt/worm/docs.\"}","call_id":"call_Ij52c3P44mpHotTyZSHkZuAp","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a081de-e0c5-7420-ae5a-a532199662b2","create_time":1788885390.897057}},{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a081e1-487a-7440-ba21-6a7a6e0b981c","call_id":"call_Ij52c3P44mpHotTyZSHkZuAp","output":"Chunk ID: f27d25\nWall time: 0.0000 seconds\nProcess exited with code 0\nOriginal token count: 0\nOutput:\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a081de-e0c5-7420-ae5a-a532199662b2","create_time":1788885420.1549437}},{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_0d4d71abca8c0b20016aa039ae516087d2868b56ff4e785fa3","summary":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABqoDmu4VSGkDe55o3l2I1FJPgZrbld2fV_y6STllj_vz9G_ShDSQAIb97_gkwTHS3Ifj1orHD5CrheMNAnvZQ7u-YefDJmlInFrnKWuAV-JqkqFTQWvzQQ3kFjYhSnaqH5M7mnhRh4Xpm4tqqiQTw70wvHRFG2vu9_MI8NrETV5ryyJ7i1aIZb0wWgCjK7330OWLszoEUFrNpplpsutu8Y3JnMzMc2XZb75whCrrunMvx3o9hblHw7_tMimdERJdwD9Kz_EXCYkuzkJacbF-OuLdI6vftrd_jtPHtT-G-cNut-Cmbqfj4QOyd