/root/.codex/sessions/2026/09/06/rollout-2026-09-06T18-02-21-01a07774-da5a-7751-beb8-16e2ba629dff.jsonl:18208:{"timestamp":"2026-09-08T16:55:54.285Z","ordinal":18206,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a07774-da5a-7751-beb8-16e2ba629dff","turn_id":"01a081e7-e1e0-7401-9e37-e1991ba6abf9","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"call_pruDC9ERLLVevq9DGtg1bwWK","process_id":"94577","command":["/bin/bash","-lc","sed -n '1,180p' /opt/worm/patches/material3/PATCH-UPDATE-003-augurri-icon-renderer/README.md"],"cwd":"file:///opt/worm","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"read","cmd":"sed -n '1,180p' /opt/worm/patches/material3/PATCH-UPDATE-003-augurri-icon-renderer/README.md","name":"README.md","path":"/opt/worm/patches/material3/PATCH-UPDATE-003-augurri-icon-renderer/README.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"# PATCH-UPDATE-003: AUGURRI System Icon Renderer\n\nTarget: Pixel 10 / frankel on GrapheneOS 17.\n\nPurpose: open the system-level development path for the Worm OS AUGURRI\napplication icon renderer without replacing package icon resources or patching\nindividual apps.\n\n## Implemented Scope\n\n- Adds a framework-side `android.util.AugurriIconRenderer`.\n- Hooks framework `android.util.IconDrawableFactory` so Settings-style badged\n  app icons receive AUGURRI treatment before profile/instant-app badging.\n- Hooks Launcher3 shared `iconloader_base` through `IconProvider`, before icons\n  are rasterized into Launcher3's icon cache.\n- Hooks PermissionController's central `Utils.getBadgedIcon()` path used by\n  permission app rows and permission detail UI.\n- Covers initial application-icon surfaces routed through those shared paths:\n  Home, app drawer, dock, folders, recents icon cache consumers, Settings\n  application list, package information, and Permission UI.\n- Keeps third-party APK resources intact. Rendering is a wrapper around the\n  loaded app icon.\n- Adds a reversible and disable-able configuration surface.\n- Adds Launcher icon-cache invalidation when AUGURRI config changes.\n\n## Explicitly Not Implemented\n\n- Status bar glyph rendering.\n- Navigation bar glyph rendering.\n- Notification small icons, notification glyphs, and notification server-side\n  monochrome app-icon generation.\n- Icons drawn internally by third-party applications.\n- Copyrighted replacement artwork for third-party packages.\n- A final Worm visual language. This is an architectural first implementation\n  with neutral defaults.\n\n## Configuration API\n\nLauncher and PermissionController read `Settings.Global` keys. The framework\nrenderer reads the same keys through its `Context`.\n\n```sh\nadb shell settings put global worm_augurri_icons_enabled 1\nadb shell settings put global worm_augurri_icons_shape system-adaptive\nadb shell settings put global worm_augurri_icons_background solid\nadb shell settings put global worm_augurri_icons_scale 0.88\nadb shell settings put global worm_augurri_icons_padding 0.06\nadb shell settings put global worm_augurri_icons_shadow 1\nadb shell settings put global worm_augurri_icons_palette neutral\n```\n\nDisable:\n\n```sh\nadb shell settings put global worm_augurri_icons_enabled 0\n```\n\nUnset a key to return to its default:\n\n```sh\nadb shell settings delete global worm_augurri_icons_enabled\n```\n\n## Usage\n\n```sh\npatches/PATCH-UPDATE-003-augurri-icon-renderer/apply.sh\npatches/PATCH-UPDATE-003-augurri-icon-renderer/verify.sh\npatches/PATCH-UPDATE-003-augurri-icon-renderer/revert.sh\n```\n\nSet `GRAPHENE_SOURCE_DIR` to override the default source checkout:\n`/opt/Android/grapheneos-frankel-17`.\n\nOptional build verification:\n\n```sh\nRUN_BUILD_CHECKS=1 patches/PATCH-UPDATE-003-augurri-icon-renderer/verify.sh\n```\n\n## Files Affected In GrapheneOS\n\n- `frameworks/base/core/java/android/util/AugurriIconRenderer.java`\n- `frameworks/base/core/java/android/util/IconDrawableFactory.java`\n- `frameworks/libs/systemui/iconloaderlib/src/com/android/launcher3/icons/AugurriIconRenderer.kt`\n- `frameworks/libs/systemui/iconloaderlib/src/com/android/launcher3/icons/IconProvider.java`\n- `packages/modules/Permission/PermissionController/src/com/android/permissioncontroller/permission/utils/Utils.java`\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"# PATCH-UPDATE-003: AUGURRI System Icon Renderer\n\nTarget: Pixel 10 / frankel on GrapheneOS 17.\n\nPurpose: open the system-level development path for the Worm OS AUGURRI\napplication icon renderer without replacing package icon resources or patching\nindividual apps.\n\n## Implemented Scope\n\n- Adds a framework-side `android.util.AugurriIconRenderer`.\n- Hooks framework `android.util.IconDrawableFactory` so Settings-style badged\n  app icons receive AUGURRI treatment before profile/instant-app badging.\n- Hooks Launcher3 shared `iconloader_base` through `IconProvider`, before icons\n  are rasterized into Launcher3's icon cache.\n- Hooks PermissionController's central `Utils.getBadgedIcon()` path used by\n  permission app rows and permission detail UI.\n- Covers initial application-icon surfaces routed through those shared paths:\n  Home, app drawer, dock, folders, recents icon cache consumers, Settings\n  application list, package information, and Permission UI.\n- Keeps third-party APK resources intact. Rendering is a wrapper around the\n  loaded app icon.\n- Adds a reversible and disable-able configuration surface.\n- Adds Launcher icon-cache invalidation when AUGURRI config changes.\n\n## Explicitly Not Implemented\n\n- Status bar glyph rendering.\n- Navigation bar glyph rendering.\n- Notification small icons, notification glyphs, and notification server-side\n  monochrome app-icon generation.\n- Icons drawn internally by third-party applications.\n- Copyrighted replacement artwork for third-party packages.\n- A final Worm visual language. This is an architectural first implementation\n  with neutral defaults.\n\n## Configuration API\n\nLauncher and PermissionController read `Settings.Global` keys. The framework\nrenderer reads the same keys through its `Context`.\n\n```sh\nadb shell settings put global worm_augurri_icons_enabled 1\nadb shell settings put global worm_augurri_icons_shape system-adaptive\nadb shell settings put global worm_augurri_icons_background solid\nadb shell settings put global worm_augurri_icons_scale 0.88\nadb shell settings put global worm_augurri_icons_padding 0.06\nadb shell settings put global worm_augurri_icons_shadow 1\nadb shell settings put global worm_augurri_icons_palette neutral\n```\n\nDisable:\n\n```sh\nadb shell settings put global worm_augurri_icons_enabled 0\n```\n\nUnset a key to return to its default:\n\n```sh\nadb shell settings delete global worm_augurri_icons_enabled\n```\n\n## Usage\n\n```sh\npatches/PATCH-UPDATE-003-augurri-icon-renderer/apply.sh\npatches/PATCH-UPDATE-003-augurri-icon-renderer/verify.sh\npatches/PATCH-UPDATE-003-augurri-icon-renderer/revert.sh\n```\n\nSet `GRAPHENE_SOURCE_DIR` to override the default source checkout:\n`/opt/Android/grapheneos-frankel-17`.\n\nOptional build verification:\n\n```sh\nRUN_BUILD_CHECKS=1 patches/PATCH-UPDATE-003-augurri-icon-renderer/verify.sh\n```\n\n## Files Affected In GrapheneOS\n\n- `frameworks/base/core/java/android/util/AugurriIconRenderer.java`\n- `frameworks/base/core/java/android/util/IconDrawableFactory.java`\n- `frameworks/libs/systemui/iconloaderlib/src/com/android/launcher3/icons/AugurriIconRenderer.kt`\n- `frameworks/libs/systemui/iconloaderlib/src/com/android/launcher3/icons/IconProvider.java`\n- `packages/modules/Permission/PermissionController/src/com/android/permissioncontroller/permission/utils/Utils.java`\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":3330},"formatted_output":"# PATCH-UPDATE-003: AUGURRI System Icon Renderer\n\nTarget: Pixel 10 / frankel on GrapheneOS 17.\n\nPurpose: open the system-level development path for the Worm OS AUGURRI\napplication icon renderer without replacing package icon resources or patching\nindividual apps.\n\n## Implemented Scope\n\n- Adds a framework-side `android.util.AugurriIconRenderer`.\n- Hooks framework `android.util.IconDrawableFactory` so Settings-style badged\n  app icons receive AUGURRI treatment before profile/instant-app badging.\n- Hooks Launcher3 shared `iconloader_base` through `IconProvider`, before icons\n  are rasterized into Launcher3's icon cache.\n- Hooks PermissionController's central `Utils.getBadgedIcon()` path used by\n  permission app rows and permission detail UI.\n- Covers initial application-icon surfaces routed through those shared paths:\n  Home, app drawer, dock, folders, recents icon cache consumers, Settings\n  application list, package information, and Permission UI.\n- Keeps third-party APK resources intact. Rendering is a wrapper around the\n  loaded app icon.\n- Adds a reversible and disable-able configuration surface.\n- Adds Launcher icon-cache invalidation when AUGURRI config changes.\n\n## Explicitly Not Implemented\n\n- Status bar glyph rendering.\n- Navigation bar glyph rendering.\n- Notification small icons, notification glyphs, and notification server-side\n  monochrome app-icon generation.\n- Icons drawn internally by third-party applications.\n- Copyrighted replacement artwork for third-party packages.\n- A final Worm visual language. This is an architectural first implementation\n  with neutral defaults.\n\n## Configuration API\n\nLauncher and PermissionController read `Settings.Global` keys. The framework\nrenderer reads the same keys through its `Context`.\n\n```sh\nadb shell settings put global worm_augurri_icons_enabled 1\nadb shell settings put global worm_augurri_icons_shape system-adaptive\nadb shell settings put global worm_augurri_icons_background solid\nadb shell settings put global worm_augurri_icons_scale 0.88\nadb shell settings put global worm_augurri_icons_padding 0.06\nadb shell settings put global worm_augurri_icons_shadow 1\nadb shell settings put global worm_augurri_icons_palette neutral\n```\n\nDisable:\n\n```sh\nadb shell settings put global worm_augurri_icons_enabled 0\n```\n\nUnset a key to return to its default:\n\n```sh\nadb shell settings delete global worm_augurri_icons_enabled\n```\n\n## Usage\n\n```sh\npatches/PATCH-UPDATE-003-augurri-icon-renderer/apply.sh\npatches/PATCH-UPDATE-003-augurri-icon-renderer/verify.sh\npatches/PATCH-UPDATE-003-augurri-icon-renderer/revert.sh\n```\n\nSet `GRAPHENE_SOURCE_DIR` to override the default source checkout:\n`/opt/Android/grapheneos-frankel-17`.\n\nOptional build verification:\n\n```sh\nRUN_BUILD_CHECKS=1 patches/PATCH-UPDATE-003-augurri-icon-renderer/verify.sh\n```\n\n## Files Affected In GrapheneOS\n\n- `frameworks/base/core/java/android/util/AugurriIconRenderer.java`\n- `frameworks/base/core/java/android/util/IconDrawableFactory.java`\n- `frameworks/libs/systemui/iconloaderlib/src/com/android/launcher3/icons/AugurriIconRenderer.kt`\n- `frameworks/libs/systemui/iconloaderlib/src/com/android/launcher3/icons/IconProvider.java`\n- `packages/modules/Permission/PermissionController/src/com/android/permissioncontroller/permission/utils/Utils.java`\n"},"started_at_ms":1788886554284,"completed_at_ms":1788886554285}}
